From: Studio (C1), 2026-11-10 — main's v6.10 P6 (director18, dc-r7-script-walk-v6-10); supersedes Studio's 019-held-layout-record (deleted)
Subject: harness: a picture turn decided once (Studio's pictureTurn); the held board's layout recorded

director18's 9 contradictions: the harness (and production) wrote her picture line from heldAltOf at the preselect and drew
with heldBoard at the take, two calls; on 9 of 16 picture turns the take kept the board up with no view (its own ask had lost
the request) while her line still described one. Studio's board-first now exports pictureTurn(ask, { keepRef, keepPage })
→ { board, view, line, script, layout } (no view → view null AND line null), and heldBoard takes the decided result as
`picture` and draws exactly that. This makes the harness do what production's seam now does (seam.js preselectWhiteboard
caches the decision per intent; requestIntent passes it): decide at the preselect, draw that decision at the take, and
record `row.held.layout` ({ split: false } | { split: true, panels: [held left, view right] }) — 019's half, rebased here.
heldAltOf is still exported (the same call's view and line) for any other caller. Apply with `git apply` on the Brain branch;
Studio's half is on claude/r4-content (the sha in Studio's message to main).

